{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07359","headline":"吴中闻潼关失守因奉寄淮南萧判官 · 刘长卿","name":"吴中闻潼关失守因奉寄淮南萧判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一鴈飞吴天，羁人伤暮律。\n松江风嫋嫋，波上片帆疾。\n木落姑苏台，霜收洞庭橘。\n萧条长洲外，唯见寒山出。\n胡马嘶秦云，汉兵乱相失。\n关中因窃据，天下共忧栗。\n南楚有琼枝，相思怨瑶瑟。\n一身寄沧洲，万里看白日。\n赴敌甘负戈，论兵勇投笔。\n临风但攘臂，择木将委质。\n不如归远山，云卧饭松栗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07359.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07359","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}